<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" version="1.1" creator="VitaBandet composite">
  <metadata>
    <name>Vita Bandet 2028 (composite)</name>
    <desc>Composite route for Vita Bandet 2028. Each leg is a separate trkseg (no straight lines across joins). Sources: Erik (Grövelsjön→Helags — dense Långfjället+Rogen, VGB-väster-om at Helags), Lotta &amp; Björn (Helags→Storlien→Gäddede — passes Blåhammaren and Storlien village), Mårten (Hemavan→Kvikkjokk, Abisko→Pältsa), Ola (Gäddede→Lapplandsleden join), lapland-trail-summer.gpx (Lapplandsleden→Hemavan via Klimpfjäll), Paolo (Kvikkjokk→Abisko via Padjelanta-west corridor).</desc>
  </metadata>
